COMMENT ON COLUMN employee_education.employee_id IS '임직원';

COMMENT ON COLUMN employee_education.school_name IS '학교명';

COMMENT ON COLUMN employee_education.major IS '전공';

COMMENT ON COLUMN employee_education.degree IS '학위 - (가정) 학위 구분 전체 목록 미확인으로 자유 입력';

COMMENT ON COLUMN employee_education.admission_date IS '입학일';

COMMENT ON COLUMN employee_education.graduation_date IS '졸업일';

COMMENT ON COLUMN employee_education.graduation_status IS '졸업 구분 - (가정) 졸업·재학·수료 등 전체 목록 미확인으로 자유 입력';

