COMMENT ON COLUMN employee_career.employee_id IS '임직원';

COMMENT ON COLUMN employee_career.company_name IS '근무처명';

COMMENT ON COLUMN employee_career.department_name IS '근무부서 - 외부 경력의 부서명 텍스트';

COMMENT ON COLUMN employee_career.position_title IS '직위·직책';

COMMENT ON COLUMN employee_career.job_description IS '담당업무';

COMMENT ON COLUMN employee_career.start_date IS '근무 시작일 - (가정) 경력 식별에 필수';

COMMENT ON COLUMN employee_career.end_date IS '근무 종료일 - 재직 중이면 NULL';

